        "description": "ThingLink for Meta Quest serves as your immersive learning solution for annotated content and courses created with ThingLink. Engage with a variety of spatial computing experiences, including immersive courses, annotated images/videos, captivating 360-degree media, and interactive 3D models - allowing you to explore objects, mechanisms, and environments in astonishing detail and from every angle.\n\nThingLink for Meta Quest is a proven tool that deepens understanding and positively impacts learning retention through immersion in a variety of multimodal experiences. Whether used for education, upskilling, employee training, or personal growth - ThingLink for Meta Quest makes it easy to explore the world, learn new concepts, and develop new skills in an innovative and engaging way.",
